# Import Order Guide

Follow the steps below to set up the Customer Intelligence & Retail Analytics Platform.

---

## Step 1

Run:

create_database.sql

This creates the database.

---

## Step 2

Run:

01_Database/create_tables.sql

This creates all tables with primary keys and foreign keys.

---

## Step 3

Import the datasets into MySQL in the following order.

The order is important because of foreign key relationships.

1. customers.xlsx
2. products.xlsx
3. marketing_campaigns.xlsx
4. orders.xlsx
5. order_items.xlsx
6. payments.xlsx
7. reviews.xlsx
8. returns.xlsx
9. customer_campaigns.xlsx
10. wishlist.xlsx

---

## Step 4

Run

indexes.sql

---

## Step 5

Run

views.sql

---

## Step 6

Run

functions.sql

---

## Step 7

Run

procedures.sql

---

## Step 8

Run

triggers.sql

---

## Step 9

Explore all business reports inside

03_SQL_Reports/

---

Database setup is now complete.